Cat Clip Composer 0.1.30

- Labels the bordered Project Preview actions as Prerender Frame, Range, and All with LQ/HQ choices.
- Queues prerenders visibly and reports scope, frame counts, and render stages in the status bar.
- Restores green preview coverage only for exact project fingerprints, including after undo.
- Pastes at empty compatible lanes and drags non-source effects between compatible timelines.
- Makes undo depth configurable (32 by default) and exposes action/export/log history.
- Adds text stroke width, smoothness, and color while keeping editor frame text visible despite fades.
- Preserves top text layers and safely renders multiline text containing unsupported combining marks.
- Adds clip inspection for file, technical, catalog, reference, and completed-export information.
